<Layout lang="en" title="Privacy Policy — Pip24h" description="Pip24h's privacy policy.">
	<article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p><em>Last updated: August 11, 2026</em></p>

		<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
		<p>
			Pip24h may collect information you provide directly (e.g. your email if you subscribe to our newsletter)
			and information collected automatically when you visit the site (e.g. IP address, browser type, pages
			viewed) through standard analytics tools.
		</p>

		<h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
		<p>
			Information is used to operate and improve the site, send our newsletter if you've subscribed, and measure
			content performance. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.
		</p>

		<h2>3. Cookies</h2>
		<p>
			The site may use cookies to remember your preferences and for analytics purposes. You can disable cookies
			in your browser, though some features may not work as intended.
		</p>

		<h2>4. External Links</h2>
		<p>
			The site contains links to third-party brokers, including affiliate links (see our
			<a href="/en/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>). We are not responsible for the privacy
			practices or content of these third-party sites.
		</p>

		<h2>5. Contact</h2>
		<p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us via the email address listed on the site.</p>
	</article>
</Layout>
